type: software
title: "GUY - Control Flow Graphs"
abstract: >-
  GUY is a Visual Studio Code extension that generates interactive
  control-flow graphs for Python, Java, PHP, C, Go and Rust, computes
  cyclomatic complexity and independent path metrics, and links each
  graph node back to its source code.
